# Mutant Chain Reaction: "up to one" target, so it is cast with none and still creates a Mutagen token.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mutant Chain Reaction
Forest x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Mutant Chain Reaction.Cast()
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mutagen Token
